title: Changes to atoms and changes to relationships require separate commitment statuses.
pid: a76f503b-f796-42b6-9922-ba64e49d50aa
body: |2-
  Suppose A and B both contain C, and C is deleted.
  The user wants to separately OK each of
  - the deletion of C
  - the deletion of (A contains C)
  - the deletion of (B contains C)
  *But* they are likely to want to do that all from C!
